OL,3,AFormer Liberian vice president charged
OL,4,Ain drug-trafficking probe
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiberia has charged former Vice
OL,7,FPresident Jewel Howard-Taylor with drug
OL,8,Ftrafficking, money laundering and a
OL,9,Frange of other offences, the country's
OL,10,FJustice Ministry announced.
OL,12,FHoward-Taylor, who served as vice
OL,13,Fpresident for six years to 2024, was
OL,14,Fdetained before boarding a flight to
OL,15,Fleave Liberia at Roberts International
OL,16,FAirport in the capital, Monrovia.
OL,18,FShe was taken to national police
OL,19,Fheadquarters, and has yet to make any
OL,20,Fpublic comments about the charges.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
