OL,3,AFormer Liberian vice president charged
OL,4,Ain drug-trafficking probe
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe West African country has launched a
OL,7,Fmajor crackdown of transnational drug
OL,8,Ftrades, particularly cocaine
OL,9,Ftrafficking, in recent years.
